<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>忆安智护 - 身份选择</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            color: white;
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }

        .header p {
            font-size: 20px;
            opacity: 0.95;
        }

        .role-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .role-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 40px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
            display: block;
        }

        .role-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .role-card.caregiver:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
        }

        .role-card.doctor:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3c72 0%, #2a5298 100%);
            color: white;
        }

        .role-card.family:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fa709a 0%, #fee140 100%);
            color: white;
        }

        .role-card.elder:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a8edea 0%, #fed6e3 100%);
            color: white;
        }

        .role-icon {
            font-size: 80px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: block;
        }

        .role-title {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .role-desc {
            font-size: 14px;
            opacity: 0.7;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
            opacity: 0.8;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .header h1 {
                font-size: 32px;
            }

            .header p {
                font-size: 16px;
            }

            .role-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
                gap: 20px;
            }

            .role-card {
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }

            .role-icon {
                font-size: 60px;
            }

            .role-title {
                font-size: 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>忆安智护</h1>
            <p>请选择您的身份进入系统</p>
        </div>

        <div class="role-grid">
            <a href="/web/caregiver_chat.html" class="role-card caregiver">
                <span class="role-icon">👩‍⚕️</span>
                <div class="role-title">护工端</div>
                <div class="role-desc">对话记录生命体征、护理情况、用药信息</div>
            </a>

            <a href="/web/doctor_chat.html" class="role-card doctor">
                <span class="role-icon">👨‍⚕️</span>
                <div class="role-title">医生端</div>
                <div class="role-desc">对话查询健康数据、趋势分析、诊断建议</div>
            </a>

            <a href="/web/family_chat.html" class="role-card family">
                <span class="role-icon">👨‍👩‍👧</span>
                <div class="role-title">家属端</div>
                <div class="role-desc">对话询问老人健康状况、护理情况</div>
            </a>

            <a href="/web/elder_voice_chat.html" class="role-card elder">
                <span class="role-icon">👴</span>
                <div class="role-title">老人端</div>
                <div class="role-desc">语音对话、大字显示、简单易用</div>
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>Context-Keeper 养老院智能护理系统 v1.0</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
